// P03.26 (R10): a chain of parentheses is evaluated bottom-up past 16 links
// (prepareChain), and the forms above it still do their setup first: the
// receiver of IsNil / Get is not narrowed (E0178 came for 15 or more
// parentheses), and the `&` above the chain still allows the part it takes
// the address of (E0395 came). Accepted at 14 and 30 parentheses; the same
// shapes without the setup stay errors at both sizes.
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-paren-chain.py 14 ok > %t.14ok.gopp
// RUN: %gopp check %t.14ok.gopp
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-paren-chain.py 30 ok > %t.30ok.gopp
// RUN: %gopp check %t.30ok.gopp
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-paren-chain.py 14 bad > %t.14bad.gopp
// RUN: not %gopp check --check-error-limit=0 %t.14bad.gopp 2>&1 | grep -o 'error\[E[0-9]*\]' | FileCheck %s
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/gen-paren-chain.py 30 bad > %t.30bad.gopp
// RUN: not %gopp check --check-error-limit=0 %t.30bad.gopp 2>&1 | grep -o 'error\[E[0-9]*\]' | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: error[E0178]
// CHECK-NEXT: error[E0395]
// CHECK-NEXT: error[E0395]
